title: Fix NODE_V8_COVERAGE lcov corruption in test helpers
description: "Override NODE_V8_COVERAGE to /dev/null in test/helpers/sandbox.ts and test/preflight.test.ts so spawned pm processes do not corrupt the test runner's V8 coverage data, which intermittently produced an empty lcov.info file."
